Description: skimrID is a derivative package developed from the original
    skimr package to enhance exploratory data analysis workflows.
    The package extends the functionality of skimr by providing
    Indonesian-language descriptive summaries through skim_indo(),
    extended descriptive statistics through skim_extended(),
    and automatic data preprocessing through skim_preprocess().
    The preprocessing function supports duplicate removal,
    missing value imputation, outlier treatment using
    Winsorization, and log transformation for highly skewed
    variables, allowing users to perform data exploration
    and preprocessing within a single package.
